      "note": "Lower priority than sm-iptv-jiohotstar (140), so this is a backup route rather than a primary. Every one of its 113 entries carries the author's credit in the channel name and in the group title; the strip_patterns below belong to this source only, because 'By @rtxcric' is noise here and could be part of a legitimate name somewhere else.",
